# L §5.7 defines `x in K` for kinds; L §5.18/§2.3 for key lists.  A membership test in an index has no stated
# meaning: LOAD-UNIT at load (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index ks = [a, b]
def c[k in ks]: bool = k in ks at reader

ask q: c[a] law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
